= Definition

#definition(title: [Field])[
    A _field_ is a #pedia("Ring", <commutative>)[commutative ring] $k$ with $0 != 1$ in which every nonzero element is invertible: for each $a != 0$, there exists $a^(-1) in k$ such that
    $ a a^(-1) = 1. $
] <definition>
